<title>UK: UK meals/feeds close firmer but tradeless.</title>
<headline>UK meals/feeds close firmer but tradeless.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>UK meals and feeds closed firmer in line with overnight trends but was tradeless due to another day of uncertainty over currency volatilty.</p>
<p>&quot;While sterling keeps jumping about against a number of other currencies, trade in the UK will remain very difficult,&quot; one trader said.</p>
<p>Soybean meal selling levels finished one to four stg higher.</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +44 171 542 8074</p>
</text>
